    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 25th June 2003, the proposed roof extension, as shown on Drawing No. 1 dated May 2003 received 12th June 2003, which increases the original volume of the house at 24 Whitehall Park Road, by 39.75m3, would be lawful within the meaning of section 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for the following reason:\r\n\r\nThe proposed development falls within Class B of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 1995. Planning permission is therefore not required.\r\n"
